## Optional Mbed TLS relay build

`zig build relay-tls-build` downloads the official Mbed TLS 4.2.0 release
archive from the Mbed TLS project, verifies the SHA-256 digest recorded in
`tools/deps/fetch-mbedtls.sh`, and compiles only the private TLS/X.509/crypto
source subset. The downloaded source is not committed to this repository or
used by the default build. Mbed TLS and its TF-PSA-Crypto subtree are offered
under Apache-2.0 or GPL-2.0-or-later; Glowcap selects the Apache-2.0 option.
The complete license remains in the verified archive as `LICENSE`; Glowcap's
copy of Apache-2.0 is `LICENSE-APACHE`.

